ength * 18)}%"></i></span><small>${set.cards.length} cartões · continuar revisão</small></div><b>↗</b></button>`).join('')}</div></div><aside class="learning-aside"><div class="calendar-head"><h3>Agenda de estudos</h3><span>${month}</span></div><div class="calendar-card"><div class="calendar-month"><strong>${month.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + month.slice(1)} ${date.getFullYear()}</strong><span>‹ &nbsp; ›</span></div><div class="calendar-week">${['seg','ter','qua','qui','sex','sáb','dom'].map(day => `<span>${day}</span>`).join('')}</div><div class="calendar-days">${calendarDays.map(day => `<span class="${day.current ? '' : 'muted-day'} ${day.selected ? 'today-day' : ''} ${day.marked ? 'marked-day' : ''}">${day.value}</span>`).join('')}</div></div><div class="schedule-list">${todayTasks.slice(0, 3).map((task, index) => `<button class="schedule-item schedule-${index}" data-action="toggle-task" data-task-id="${task.id}"><span class="schedule-icon">▤</span><span><strong>${escapeHtml(task.title)}</strong><small>${escapeHtml(task.type)} · ${task.estimate} min</small></span></button>`).join('') || `<div class="schedule-empty">Nenhuma tarefa pendente para hoje.</div>`}</div></aside></div></section>`;
